Package: senaceR
Title: Programmatic Access to SENACE Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul Efren", "Santos Andrade",
    email = "paulfrenes@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
  )
Description: An R interface for the REST API of the SENACE Open Data Portal
    (National Service for Environmental Certification of Sustainable Investments).
    Download current datasets with a personal API key or use the bundled local
    snapshots for offline work.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
